---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /fantasy-recs/
title: Fantasy Recommendations
---

<section class="content-section">
  <h1>Fantasy Recommendations - In Progress</h1>

  <p>
    These are the books I think are best to begin each subgenre, or just for getting started with fantasy in general.
  </p>

  {% for genre in genres %}
    <section class="genre-section">
      <h2 class="genre-title">{{ genre.name }}</h2>
      <h3 class="genre-description">{{ genre.description }}</h3>

      <ul class="series-list">
        {% for item in genre.series %}
          <li class="series-item">
            <a class="series-title" href="/books/?series={{ item.slug | lower | urlencode }}">
              {{ item.title }}
            </a>
            <p class="series-description">
              {{ item.description }}
            </p>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="info-section">
    <p>
      Will continue to be updated
    </p>
  </div>

</section>